  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '"COSTCO": A variation of TicTacToe played on a larger board. After one
    player connections 3-in-a-row, the game enters "Cascade" phase. Every turn, a
    player must make a connection, or they are eliminated. The last player to make
    a connection wins.


    Connections that go on multiple axes cause x2 or higher
    Cascades. Opponents must also have a Cascade of the same size or larger.


    4-in-a-row
    and 5-in-a-row connections are not worth extra. You can''t extend an existing
    -in-a-row with new moves.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
